Apple has been celebrating its upcoming 50th anniversary by hosting <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/25/apple-50th-anniversary-events-uk-australia/">surprise performances</a> and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/03/27/apple-50th-anniversary-washington-dc-tokyo/">other events around the world</a> over the past few weeks, and now <em>Bloomberg</em>'s Mark Gurman has revealed details about the company's grand finale.<br/>
<br/>
