In a <a href="https://x.com/markgurman/status/2037990058364715452">social media post</a>, Gurman said Apple's celebrations will conclude this week with a finale at its Apple Park headquarters for employees.<br/>
<br/>
A special guest will perform, according to Gurman. He hinted at Paul McCartney.<br/>
<br/>
